= Information — Simple =

'''Information''' is something that helps distinguish possibilities, represent facts, or reduce uncertainty.

The word has different meanings in different fields.

In communication theory, information is measured mathematically from probabilities.

That mathematical measure does not tell us whether a message is true or meaningful.

Data and information are related, but they are not always the same thing.

